Looking at the test case, the expected URL is `https://test.com/foo%20bar/%5BOne%5D?q=white%20space#frag`, but the actual URL remains `https://test.com/foo bar/[One]?q=white space#frag`. This indicates that while spaces are being replaced manually with `%20`, other special characters like `[` and `]` are not being encoded.

I need to ensure that the entire URL is properly encoded, including path and query parameters.

